    },
    {
      "id": "ME-D03",
      "source_id": "damodaran.cyclical-commodity.2009",
      "quote": "As the oil price changes, the operating income and the return on capital change; we keep the capital invested number fixed at $10,629 million and re-estimate the return on capital with the estimated operating income.",
